    {
      "id": "text-33",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 1031.68,
      "height": 100.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1474831185,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1488148247,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792439358949,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Read and write tools are separate connectors; scheduled agents get read scopes by default.\n• A connector that changes its tool list after approval needs approval again.\n• SSRF checks on every discovery URL (no private IPs, https only).\n• Gmail read scopes are restricted → annual CASA assessment. Launch with Calendar, Drive and gmail.send.\n• Google, Slack and GitHub (device flow) all allow public mobile clients without a client secret.",
      "originalText": "• Read and write tools are separate connectors; scheduled agents get read scopes by default.\n• A connector that changes its tool list after approval needs approval again.\n• SSRF checks on every discovery URL (no private IPs, https only).\n• Gmail read scopes are restricted → annual CASA assessment. Launch with Calendar, Drive and gmail.send.\n• Google, Slack and GitHub (device flow) all allow public mobile clients without a client secret.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
